WEBVTT

00:02:58.382 --> 00:03:00.218
And I'll throw in my pet frog,"

00:03:00.259 --> 00:03:03.804
makes people willing to pay
nearly 20 percent more.

00:03:04.722 --> 00:03:07.225
Really let it sink in,

00:03:07.266 --> 00:03:09.477
just how bad that joke is.

00:03:09.477 --> 00:03:10.645
(Laughter)

00:03:10.686 --> 00:03:12.313
NB: "I'll throw in my pet frog."

00:03:12.355 --> 00:03:14.815
JA: The bar is so low.
NB: It's extreme.

00:03:14.857 --> 00:03:16.067
(Laughter)

00:03:16.108 --> 00:03:18.236
NB: Very low.
JA: Could not be lower.

00:03:18.236 --> 00:03:19.987
(Laughter)

00:03:19.987 --> 00:03:22.657
JA: Laughter shortens the path
to connection as well.

00:03:22.698 --> 00:03:25.618
So when strangers share a laugh
before a conversation,

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:29.205
they end up disclosing
more personal information,

00:03:29.247 --> 00:03:30.581
so they feel closer.